{"id":340,"date":"2017-05-27T11:02:21","date_gmt":"2017-05-27T10:02:21","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/?page_id=340"},"modified":"2021-02-15T12:29:02","modified_gmt":"2021-02-15T12:29:02","slug":"microsoft-training-onsite-remote","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/microsoft-training-onsite-remote\/","title":{"rendered":"On-site &#038; Remote Microsoft Excel Training"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What makes us different?<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><li>\u00bd day courses available<\/li><li>Onsite courses<\/li><li>We will help you create a course structure that reflects your exact needs for training, so that the training we deliver will cover 100% the topics that your people need.<\/li><li>Your course can cover&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/understanding-excel\/\">Excel<\/a>, Word, PowerPoint or Outlook or a combination \u2013 its up to you.<\/li><li>All the spreadsheets and&nbsp;documents used in the training, will be yours to take home. This makes the training as practical and targeted as possible.<\/li><li>\u2018Hot-line\u2019 service to help with follow-up queries<\/li><\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Types of Microsoft training courses available<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><li>1-2-1 training sessions ,<\/li><li>Small Group&nbsp;training<\/li><li>Large group&nbsp;training<\/li><li>Remote\/on-line&nbsp;training<\/li><\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Microsoft Office 2013, 2011, 2010, 2007 and 2003 training available. As well as system upgrade training.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Our <a href=\"\/\">Excel Consultants<\/a> will be happy to&nbsp;discuss your requirements and give you a quote within a working day.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The training is suitable for:<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><li>All levels of employee.&nbsp;From all departments and levels of experience, both basic and advanced.<\/li><li>&nbsp;Suitable for PCs or Macs.<\/li><\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Our documents or yours<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We can also&nbsp;use your own spreadsheets or documents throughout the training.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We can&nbsp;develop&nbsp;and improve any spreadsheets&nbsp;you currently use,&nbsp;if required.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Basic or Advanced \u2013 your choice<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"font-inherit wp-block-paragraph\">Training courses are also available for anyone who wants to go back to basics. This could&nbsp;include, for example,&nbsp;a basic guide to email.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Or the basics around Excel, Word, PowerPoint, Outlook.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Advanced Microsoft training is also available.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Microsoft Excel training topics include:<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"font-inherit wp-block-paragraph\">Pivot tables, Charts, Sorting, Filtering, data manipulation and formulas including Vlookups, IF and SUMIF.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Microsoft PowerPoint training topics include:<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"font-inherit wp-block-paragraph\">Slide masters, animation, transitions, alignment and SmartArt.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Microsoft Word training topics include:<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"font-inherit wp-block-paragraph\">Contents, bullets and numbering, footnotes and cross-referencing.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Microsoft Outlook training topics include:<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"font-inherit wp-block-paragraph\">Setting up flagging items, updating contacts and tasks, setting up rules and diary management.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>What makes us different? \u00bd day courses available Onsite courses We will help you create a course structure that reflects your exact needs for trai